<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '20px 70px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4, letterSpacing: 1 }}>08 / 教学协同 Agent</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 32, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.3 }}>学生工作流：诊断解释与任务安排</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '7px 16px', borderRadius: 20, background: '#1E7BE0' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 600 }}>设计中</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 532, paddingTop: 8, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', flex: 1, justifyContent: 'center', gap: 16 }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20, flex: 1 }}><Box style={{ width: 270, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E3E8EF', borderRadius: 8, overflow: 'hidden', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 4, background: 'linear-gradient(90deg, #1E7BE0 0%, #00A9B5 100%)' }} /><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, padding: 20, flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>方法识别</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>不知道该用哪个套路</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 270, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E3E8EF', borderRadius: 8, overflow: 'hidden', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 4, background: 'linear-gradient(90deg, #1E7BE0 0%, #00A9B5 100%)' }} /><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, padding: 20, flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>知识条件</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>概念或适用条件不清楚</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 270, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E3E8EF', borderRadius: 8, overflow: 'hidden', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 4, background: 'linear-gradient(90deg, #1E7BE0 0%, #00A9B5 100%)' }} /><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, padding: 20, flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>局部步骤</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>某一步反复做错</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 270, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E3E8EF', borderRadius: 8, overflow: 'hidden', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 4, background: 'linear-gradient(90deg, #1E7BE0 0%, #00A9B5 100%)' }} /><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, padding: 20, flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>执行问题</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>方法对但运算出错</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: '#F5F7FA', borderLeft: '4px solid #1E7BE0', borderRadius: 6, padding: '14px 20px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>回答“今天学什么”时综合：课时、必做作业、套路顺序、知识准备、到期复查、个人时间预算——避免各模块分别追加任务。任务结束后区分五种完成状态：独立完成 / 提示后完成 / 看过答案 / 跳过 / 仍待核实</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: '#F5F7FA', borderLeft: '4px solid #98A2B3', borderRadius: 6, padding: '14px 20px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>提示渐退和探究任务在研究完成前不作为稳定能力承诺；不把教学过程中的顺利完成直接写成长期掌握</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E3E8EF', marginTop: 8 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>依据：教学协同Agent设计.md §4</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}> 81 / 124 </Text></Box></Slide>